# Per-machine compose environment: the ngrok URL Anthropic dials, the API key that pays for a
# GDPR review, and the token that must match the GDPR runtime. Never committed.
docker/dockercompose/.env

# The ComplianceContext catalogue seeded into the 'jena' scope on first start (issue #332).
# Generated data, not source - and not ours to redistribute: the Grundschutz++ catalogue is
# CC BY-SA 4.0 and the ISO 27001 mapping carries only identifiers because the text is
# protected. The README beside this mount says where to get the files.
docker/dockercompose/initial-models/**
!docker/dockercompose/initial-models/README.md
